00:01:13.735 --> 00:01:13.895
Unaware of what connects us

00:01:19.273 --> 00:01:19.402
Listen to the forest

00:01:23.311 --> 00:01:23.457
Listen to the ground

00:01:27.495 --> 00:01:27.650
