00:02:39.482 --> 00:02:39.614
Where countless lives and signals meet

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:43.477
Not to conquer

00:02:45.322 --> 00:02:45.423
Not to own

00:02:47.573 --> 00:02:47.689
But to understand

00:02:51.698 --> 00:02:51.775
Listen to the forest

00:02:51.798 --> 00:02:51.924
Listen to the ground

